<title>FINLAND: Finnish 2006 bond yields 6.29 pct at auction.</title>
<headline>Finnish 2006 bond yields 6.29 pct at auction.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-05-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following issue of the S1/96</p>
<p>bond was announced by the State Treasury Office  SUVL :</p>
<p> ISSUER:				 Republic of Finland</p>
<p> MATURITY:			     18-04-2006</p>
<p> COUPON:				 7.25 PCT</p>
<p> AUCTION YIELD:			6.29 PCT</p>
<p> PRICE:				  106.35</p>
<p> AUCTION AMOUNT			FIM 3,333 MLN</p>
<p> BID AMOUNT:			   FIM 7,596 MLN</p>
<p> PAYMENT FREQUENCY:		  YEARLY</p>
<p>NOTES: After this auction, the outstanding amount is 26,139 million markka.</p>
<p>The previous auction of the bond raised 2,066 million markka at a price of 106.10 and a yield of 6.34 percent.</p>
<p>-- Helsinki newsroom +358-9-6805 0240, news@reuters.fi</p>
